{
  "bookId": "hero-211011",
  "id": "bond-26003",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26003001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "是你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "26003003",
              "text": "又睡着了吗？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "26003003",
              "text": "打扰到你了吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "26003002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26003003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "没有，我在想一个问题。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "26003005",
              "text": "什么问题？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "26003004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26003005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "被制造出来的我们，在诞生之初，都被赋予了唯一的使命。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26003006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "作为杀戮型机械，我的使命是战斗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26003007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "可是……作为「手办」的我，「使命」是什么呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "26003009",
              "text": "蒂娅觉得，什么是「使命」？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "26003008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26003009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "「使命」是世界上最重要的东西，是我存在的意义。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26003010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "如果没有「使命」，蒂娅的存在就没有意义了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26003011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "……我不知道。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26003012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那么现在，蒂娅认为世界上最重要的是什么呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26003013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26003014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "蒂娅不想说的话，下次告诉我也可以。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
